			<div class="content" id="post-content-2728118">
									

<p><strong>One small step for man, one giant leap for man's best friend.</strong></p>
<p>Special thanks to reddit user Aoneareyou60 for suggesting writing about Laika for the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/history-contest">History Contest</a>. Thanks to AidenEldritch, Conwell, TwistedGears, Greenwolf, and Apoplexic for taking a look before release.</p>
<p><strong>EDIT:</strong> I was not expecting the outpouring of support this article has gotten. Thank you, everyone who read and contributed.</p>
<p>This contest has featured some really stellar content, so below I've linked the top five in each category for easy access!</p>
<p><strong>SCP Articles:</strong></p>
<p>2nd Place: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/wrong-proposal">Wrong's Proposal for SCP-001: The Consensus</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;">MrWrong</a></span></p>
<p>3rd Place: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2736">SCP-2736 - The Age of Nixon</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hercules-rockefeller" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2314402); return false;">Hercules Rockefeller</a></span></p>
<p>4th Place: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2664">SCP-2664 - Redline</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/a-random-day" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1841781); return false;">A Random Day</a></span></p>
<p>5th Place (tie): <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2498">SCP-2498 - The Rainbow Body</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(560062); return false;">minmin</a></span></p>
<p>5th Place (tie): <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2456">SCP-2456 - Dreams of a Broken World</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/megalan" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2947671); return false;">megalan</a></span></p>
<p><strong>Tales:</strong></p>
<p>1st Place: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/now-hollow-fires-burn-out-to-black-and-lights-are-waning-low">Now Hollow Fires Burn Out To Black And Lights Are Guttering Low</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/doctor-cimmerian" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1414765); return false;">Doctor Cimmerian</a></span></p>
<p>2nd Place: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/imperfectly-fossilized-eggs-m4rho-edope-fo5le">'Imperfectly Fossilized Eggs' (M4RHO/EDOPE/FO5LE)</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ihp" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1267048); return false;">Ihp</a></span></p>
<p>3rd Place: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/make-portland-weirder">Make Portland Weirder</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jacob-conwell" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1372582); return false;">Jacob Conwell</a></span></p>
<p>4th Place: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/what-the-spybird-saw">What The Spybird Saw</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vezaz" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1403034); return false;">Vezaz</a></span></p>
<p>5th Place: <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/matterminded">Matterminded</a>, by <span class="printuser"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/taffeta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2221240); return false;">Taffeta</a></span></p>
<p>EDIT: Due to an inability to verify the licensing of the original image, it has been replaced. <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Laika_mockup.gif">Source</a></p>

